From upstream DXMT v0.80
Subject: [PATCH] winemetal: use a POSIX shell conditional in install helper

Meson runs this helper under /bin/sh.  `==` is not POSIX and fails under
the macOS POSIX shell; quote the positional argument and use `=` instead.
This affects only the isolated candidate install helper.

--- a/src/winemetal/unix/install.sh
+++ b/src/winemetal/unix/install.sh
@@ -7,6 +7,6 @@
 cp "${MESON_BUILD_ROOT}/src/winemetal/unix/winemetal.so" "${INSTALL_DIR}/winemetal.so"
 
 
-if [ $1 == "true" ]; then
+if [ "$1" = "true" ]; then
     strip "${INSTALL_DIR}/winemetal.so" -x
 fi
